BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 716.00 Tm (If the seller changed the oil right before your sample, the lab can tell you it looks like a brand new sample,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 700.77 Tm (and 24 to 48 hour turnaround fits a used-machine purchase [EquipmentWorld - QYimn88ydQI @ 00:05:21].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 685.55 Tm (Reach in and feel the top of the bushing; a worn spot or flat edge up top means the pins and bushings have) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 670.32 Tm (already been turned [Jim Mack - YyZcRwETdeA @ 00:02:28].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 648.10 Tm (Section 3: Where Practitioners Disagree & Alternative Playbooks) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 625.87 Tm (Inspectors split first on tooling and on how to turn raw readings into one sellable number. Clinton and Kevin) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 610.65 Tm (at C&C Equipment run an ITR America kit and inspection report, tell buyers a straight edge will do if they) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 595.42 Tm (lack the fancy tools, and then sum every component reading: 3,200 equals fully worn, and their 1,010 meant) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 580.20 Tm (31 percent worn and 69 percent remaining on a 2010 Komatsu showing roughly 4,700 hours [Hif9qgd9EEI) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 564.97 Tm (@ 00:11:05]. The Cat dealer workflow is instrument-heavy, calling for the UWI 5 ultrasonic tool plus calipers,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 549.75 Tm (depth gauge, tape measures, ruler and wire brush, about half an hour for a full measure-up, with ultrasonic) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 534.52 Tm (carrier roller readings reserved for D8 through D11 while D7 and lower get calipers [fP5ysbGB2H0 @) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 519.30 Tm (00:00:19]. Komatsu Australia front-loads the ultrasonic unit with model, serial number, service meter) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 504.07 Tm (reading, inspection date and sealed or lubricated track type, and only trusts a reading once the green LED) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 488.85 Tm (lights [JCDyzlYC0h0 @ 00:01:08]. Jim Mack stays fully manual, laying a straight edge across two shoes and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 473.62 Tm (reading a CAT 5P3277 ruler for 1.68 inches of grouser and 3.54 inches of link height, then averaging several) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 458.40 Tm (locations instead of trusting a single spot [YyZcRwETdeA @ 00:00:34].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 443.17 Tm (Pitch and sprocket calls are where the specs diverge hardest. C&C Equipment measures center of pin to) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 427.95 Tm (center of pin over four links against a 761 millimeter new figure, logs 762 as 15 percent worn, and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 412.72 Tm (deliberately repeats the reading in a second spot because the chain may be taking up or sucked together at) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 397.50 Tm (one end [Hif9qgd9EEI @ 00:04:49]. Volvo's inspector says the span depends on who built the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 382.27 Tm (undercarriage, anywhere from five, four or three pins, and the number only means something once it runs) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 367.05 Tm (through that maker's conversion chart for life used or remaining [L3kAdkTSgI4 @ 00:03:05]. Komatsu) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 351.82 Tm (Australia demands a tight track before the tape goes on and measures across five pins or four links,) Tj ET
