BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 321.37 Tm (has no number at all and reads them by eye: a flat middle with roughly a half inch of room is healthy, and a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 306.15 Tm (sharp point means they are done. Hunter Valley Tracks, by contrast, runs a tape across three teeth of one) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 290.92 Tm (segment, plugs that into its own undercarriage program alongside link height, bush thickness, rollers, idlers) Tj ET
