BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 169.12 Tm (rules differ too. Mike Dudley at Carter Machinery wants about 20 minutes of operation so the fluid is fully) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 153.90 Tm (homogenized, and sampling every 250 hours unless the maintenance guide calls for something else) Tj ET
